{"title":"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/1/e010be6d83fe43aa3ff71909fdfd75d16fd16abf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy = a, xz =b,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"118\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/e/1be5b88c257300f2aa948f7c47a1782cfe43464c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$yz = c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"11\" />, and none of these quantities is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/c/17c16955e7d4315ecfb7b2796ca519dba8527b00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+y^2+z^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/2/ff29d104a98b27fa690006aa0bc1c2d44a044624.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{ab+ac+bc}{abc}\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{a^2+b^2+c^2}{abc}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{(a+b+c)^2}{abc}\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{(ab+ac+bc)^2}{abc}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{(ab)^2+(ac)^2+(bc)^2}{abc}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"876\" height=\"39\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the equations, we deduce <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/8/f7815b49489420213ea24898b86eebcc9be14223.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{a}{y}, z = \\frac{b}{x},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"108\" height=\"41\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/b/bfb1d104e4f476228b80b448ba3e6cbffdac57e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac{c}{z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"45\" height=\"33\" />. Substituting these into the expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/c/17c16955e7d4315ecfb7b2796ca519dba8527b00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+y^2+z^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" /> thus gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/2/4323de416aef73f0836e37afb1f4b437d053c6d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a^2}{y^2} + \\frac{b^2}{x^2} + \\frac{c^2}{z^2} = \\frac{a^2x^2z^2+b^2y^2z^2+c^2y^2x^2}{x^2y^2z^2} = \\frac{a^2b^2+b^2c^2+c^2a^2}{x^2y^2z^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"497\" height=\"42\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/6/a164c57ccb7e294eb7c44f8b12a962545f004f30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{(ab)^2+(ac)^2+(bc)^2}{abc}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"210\" height=\"52\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/b/76b2878564ab19b80abb21ba964abe90fe120846.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/3/dd3bb54d97893a89942c4af259e9651e3ac6901d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{abc}{c^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"27\" height=\"37\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/a/f5a3faa3658bcbd8bde8e16cfa5baf019619fc9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/8/bb806e222bc34721809ac3dc1f38dc80c681f559.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{abc}{b^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"27\" height=\"37\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/3/9c3b0b966fdafe902c6375ebef2b7fa9fdc4d223.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z^2$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/3/bb32757e1b4784ee3bf559d0cf1680b6a459f08b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{abc}{a^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"27\" height=\"37\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/c/17c16955e7d4315ecfb7b2796ca519dba8527b00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+y^2+z^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/4/8241ea40d260350e2042f05d8c78ae4d5f4caff9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{abc}{c^2}+\\frac{abc}{b^2}+\\frac{abc}{a^2}= \\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{(ab)^2+(ac)^2+(bc)^2}{abc}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"365\" height=\"50\" />\n</p><p>-purplepenguin2\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME\" title=\"1983 AHSME\">1983 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1983 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1983\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97